  "reason": "A texture passed in keeps, past the baked bytes, whatever the Editor's scratch buffer held (an uninitialized fill, bake/givenfloat); an RGBA32 one shows the floats' bytes, where a billboard normal component the Editor computes as about 4e-8 is 0 in Unbound (bake/given). Texture sizes match (bakesize/*, bakecap/*).",
  "keys": [
   "bake/given/indices",
   "bake/given/vertices",
   "bake/givenfloat/indices",
